    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d470">

                <pb facs="0568" n="494" sameAs="frus:frus1918Russiav01/pg494"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 861.00/1416</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in Russia</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Francis</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-04-05T13:00:00-04:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 5, 1918, 1 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>48. Your 52, April 1, 2 p.m. As already explained in my 21, March 23, 7
                        p.m.,<anchor n="1" xml:id="d470-f1"/> Department relies on your discretion
                    and judgment to remain in Russia so long as you can reflect friendly purpose and
                    sympathy of this Government for Russian people without imperiling self and
                    staff.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
